HX-2025-Spring:
This project presents a way to bootstrap ATS3 that leads
to the generation of a compiler-in-js for translating ATS3
to JavaScript.
########################################################################
Step1: compiling XATSOPT into JS code
Step2: compiling XATS2JS into JS code
Step4: Building xats2js_jsemit00_ats3.js
Step5: Compiling everything with xats2js_jsemit00_ats3.js
